{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Island Robot Farm is a casual idle farming simulation game. Robots can automatically plant crops, produce agricultural products, raise animals, and construct various buildings to freely develop this vast island.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the size of the game window at any time, placing it in the corner or at the bottom of the screen. While you're handling other tasks, the robots will quietly build your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=668 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automated Robots:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each robot has different abilities, and rationally assigning tasks can promote the island's development more efficiently. Robots can work automatically, or you can choose to let them randomly handle various affairs on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Alien Plants:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Earth's native plants, you can also build rockets in the game to travel to outer space, explore new plants, and bring them back to plant on your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle Simulation Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new idle simulation management gameplay. Just accept orders, plant, collect, and produce, and you can sell your beverages to the entire universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Crops, Flowers, and Fruits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different types of plants to grow, and obtain high-value products by producing these plants to increase your farm's income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/0194397f691724d9f36623aafbbb2cf8.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/0194397f691724d9f36623aafbbb2cf8.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/0194397f691724d9f36623aafbbb2cf8.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animal Breeding:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise various animals on land, harvest their products and process them to further increase resources and profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7dce11128bade2ecf94467ce09b7025a.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7dce11128bade2ecf94467ce09b7025a.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7dce11128bade2ecf94467ce09b7025a.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox Construction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely place each plot of land to build and decorate a unique island. With the development of technology, obtain various buildings with different functions, collect and unlock various items, and work together with robots to build a super-large island farm that operates automatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7d27db912baef7c95c284ea8a09338f2.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=652 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7d27db912baef7c95c284ea8a09338f2.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/7d27db912baef7c95c284ea8a09338f2.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sea Area Expansion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/2b0361b9d906fd715c8e6418b4a98e54996b5423.jpg"},{"name":"New Plot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/f6a8ff5f69507cd8ac80ba5453be47ca88f4f4bc.jpg"},{"name":"Connect Islands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/e4e71f1d53c6f82651ab75ef0c7cbf3752688ba8.jpg"},{"name":"Light up Island 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/8ae3da010a228c5f846bd65f3bbb958221f13eea.jpg"},{"name":"New Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/81400e63111252da528c85ca70b363e3fa89ccb2.jpg"},{"name":"It's Time to Name the Island","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/844fdf75a378a8637de7e88cfaee153f42eb0064.jpg"},{"name":"Technological Explosion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/88b7a07404398443addaae691b8f91108e03857a.jpg"},{"name":"Food Factory Starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/602f5a2cef2d6e0416532584d094b7c64c4f4aba.jpg"},{"name":"Beverage Factory Starts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/3f0c0908bd8185415fc60a546c7dfb9a46de4aa4.jpg"},{"name":"Flower Factory Starts Operation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3196520/942c1f0bd271aef724a69115693b9477f7ed0d9c.jpg"}],"total":41},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196520?t=1761028457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761028457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/c646eb01d663d29f8d3e8a8f4ad1c634c08b1b4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761028457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/c646eb01d663d29f8d3e8a8f4ad1c634c08b1b4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761028457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Island Robot Farm is a casual idle farming simulation game. Robots can automatically plant crops, produce agricultural products, raise animals, and construct various buildings to freely develop this vast island.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/e67bef6246c36c4fb45c40fb4689dffd.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the size of the game window at any time, placing it in the corner or at the bottom of the screen. While you're handling other tasks, the robots will quietly build your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=668 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/dfbf4f19b625f0ea942f9f2b945d937a.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Automated Robots:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each robot has different abilities, and rationally assigning tasks can promote the island's development more efficiently. Robots can work automatically, or you can choose to let them randomly handle various affairs on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/8fca29cd33712efcf641e5fd03c06a1e.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Alien Plants:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to Earth's native plants, you can also build rockets in the game to travel to outer space, explore new plants, and bring them back to plant on your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/ce28fd96a58f09e9a3cd9515d17bfc18.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/3e60877e80c72aeaf2e7fbcce9c14480.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle Simulation Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new idle simulation management gameplay. Just accept orders, plant, collect, and produce, and you can sell your beverages to the entire universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.poster.avif?t=1761028457\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.webm?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196520/extras/6004dc0b9cbd79605310dc269835de23.mp4?t=1761028457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Crops, Flowers, and Fruits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different types of plants to grow, and obtain high-value products by producing these plants to increase your farm's income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline